    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. can we make it even punchier? like, really lean into the idea that managed conservation is actually just a way for humans to micromanage nature and that it's fundamentally flawed compared to the natural autonomy of rewilding. make it sound really urgent for the grant readers.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
